 TUCK SHOP MANAGEMENT SYSTEM - UML STRUCTURE

[ Product ] <---------- (Abstract Class)
   |  - id: String
   |  - name: String
   |  - price: double
   |  - quantity: int
   |  + getDisplayInfo()*
   |
   |_______ [ Food ] <---------- (Inheritance)
               |  - category: String
               |  + getDisplayInfo()
               |
               |_______ [ PerishableFood ] <--- (Inheritance)
                           - expiryDate: String
                           + getDisplayInfo()

[ InventoryManager ]
   |  - stockList: ArrayList<Product> <--- (Composition)
   |  + sellProduct()
   |  + restockProduct()

[ Main ]
   |  + main(String[] args) <--- (Entry Point)

NOTES: 
- Product is the parent (Abstract).
- InventoryManager "Has-a" list of Products.
- PerishableFood inherits from Food.
